# gate potential p, coupling A; ring N.

== N1: two-kink interaction E_int(R) = E(R)-E_self, ring N=400 p=8 A=1.00 ==
# integer windings only: on a UNISON ring a fractional twist is not a
# soliton but a seam strain (charge_fk.c section 6), so a fractional
# pair measures nothing. That experiment belongs on a Z_Q interval chain.
