reading: sign(E_int) = sign(q1*q2), |E_int| monotone down in R, and
the two signs are antisymmetric wherever both resolve. The RANGE is
~1 site: kappa = sqrt(p/2A) = 2.00/site (charge_sym.mac PART 4).
The core-level force is CONTACT interaction. A 1/r^2 law is the EM5
dressing's job and is not tested here.

