reading: barrier ~0 => the kink translates freely (conducting);
barrier finite => it is pinned and must be depinned (LAMH).
The size condition in mobility form is where bar/E_min departs from
its large-N value. Note this is a DIFFERENT criterion from the energy
excess of charge_fk.c section 4 and it need not give the same N.

